      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Encoder Dynamic Range Control (DRC) configuration.",
      "ko": "인코더 동적 범위 제어(Encoder Dynamic Range Control, DRC) 구성입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "dbe1ca5bf4f1789a6d80de96ceeae9ee0ce6182c7e1d75a051bdfcb0ab501a7d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When supported by the encoder, this property controls which configuration is applied when a bitstream is generated.",
      "ko": "인코더에서 지원되는 경우, 이 속성은 비트스트림이 생성될 때 적용할 구성을 제어합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e78c0e55f0b2aa1f0eb18b84c5630f6e9b1a47eeb3c3019418f071d3373e4aaf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Note: This is only supported when compressing audio to formats which support it.",
      "ko": "The default value is `50%`.",
      "sourceHash": "7792382541e1785444f22725c9fdd5aeb53ec9c39bbc1f0d19840f15567bf738",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
